        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ko̱l gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ Ruath Dɛ̈ɛ̈l",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tet cuëëc raam in nyuur kɔam kuäärä, cua ko̱l gɔ̱rä mi ca rɛydɛ kɛnɛ jɔkdɛ gɔ̱r nɛn, kä ca dil kɛ di̱i̱li bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jääk nhial mi bum nɛn, latdɛ ruac kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t i̱, “Ɛŋa mi ro̱ŋ kɛ lëp köl kɛnɛ to̱li di̱i̱likɛ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ raan nhial kiɛ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n kiɛ piny muɔ̱ɔ̱n mi luäŋ lëp köl kiɛ guec rɛ̈ydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jɛ tok kɛ wiee mi di̱i̱t kɛ ɣöö cɛ thil ram kɛl mi ca jëk a ro̱ŋ kɛ lëp köl kiɛ dee rɛydɛ guic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ram kɛl kä di̱t ɣä jiök i̱, “/Cu wiee. Kä nɛnɛ. Lony thuɔk duëël Juda min la kuɛ̈ɛ̈ Dee-bid cɛ tiëm, derɛ ko̱l luäŋ kɛ lëp, kɛnɛ di̱i̱likɛ da̱ŋ bärɔw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kam kɔam kuäärä kɛnɛ ley da̱ŋ ŋuan tin tëk, kɛ rɛy di̱tni, cua Ruath Dɛ̈ɛ̈l nɛn cuŋä ce̱tkɛ mi ca ŋot, mi tekɛ tuɔ̱ŋ da̱ŋ bärɔw kɛnɛ wäŋ da̱ŋ bärɔw, tin la yiey Kuɔth da̱ŋ bärɔw tin ca jäkä wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wä, cuɛ ko̱l gɔ̱rä ka̱n tetdä cuëëc raam in nyuur kɔam kuäärä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ ko̱l gɔ̱rä ka̱n, cu ley da̱ŋ ŋuan tin tëk, kɛnɛ di̱t ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ ŋuan rɔ yuɔr piny nhiam Ruath Dɛ̈ɛ̈l, käp ramɔ thom kɛnɛ thääk dääpä ti thiäŋ kɛ wal ti waŋkɛ, tin la pal nɛɛni ti ci Kuoth kɛ lɛy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ dit mi pay cak kɛt, wäkɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua guic, kä cua̱ jɔw jaakni liŋ gekä kɔam kuäärä kɛ ley tin tëk kɛnɛ di̱t. Kä pekdiɛn kɛ jaak ti bathdɔɔri ti ŋuan ɛlɔ̱ŋ ti /ca dee luäŋ kɛ kuën. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ kiet kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
